1. The user opens the LegalEase application.
2. The user selects a legal document type.
3. The user enters the required information.
4. The user clicks the Generate button.
5. The application sends the request to the Gemini API.
6. Gemini generates a legal document draft.
7. The application displays the generated document.
8. The user downloads the document.

User Interface Components:

- Application title
- Document type selection
- Party details section
- Additional clauses text area
- Generate document button
- Generated document display
- Download button
- Legal disclaimer

Technology Architecture:

- Frontend: Streamlit
- Backend: Python
- AI Integration: Google Gemini API
- Version Control: GitHub

Expected Outcome:
A clear design plan that guides the implementation of the LegalEase application.
